#: ../../language/error_codes/E0027.md:1
msgid "E0027"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0027.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `deprecated_syntax`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0027.md:5
msgid ""
"The compiler may emit this warning when it still accepts outdated syntax "
"for compatibility. Follow the diagnostic's suggested replacement and "
"migrate the code promptly."
msgstr "当编译器为了兼容性仍接受过时语法时，可能会发出此警告。请按照诊断中建议的替代写法，尽快迁移代码。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0027.md:9
msgid ""
"Deprecated syntax is temporary and may be removed in a later compiler "
"release. After removal, the same source may produce a syntax error "
"instead of this warning. Therefore, this page does not use a checked "
"source example tied to one particular deprecated form; refer to the "
"diagnostic for its exact replacement."
msgstr ""
"弃用语法是临时兼容形式，可能会在后续编译器版本中移除。移除后，同一份源码可"
"能不再触发此警告，而是产生语法错误。因此，本页不提供绑定某一种弃用形式的受"
"检源码示例；请以具体诊断给出的替代写法为准。"
